0,Pahari Kinnauri language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pahari_Kinnauri_language,"April 7, 2026 - Pahari Kinnauri, or Kinnauri Pahari (Takri: 𑚊𑚮𑚝𑚵𑚤𑚯 𑚞𑚩𑚭𑚪𑚯), is the only Indo-Aryan language among the nine languages spoken in the Kinnaur district of Himachal Pradesh. It is also called Oras Boli (Takri: 𑚈𑚤𑚭𑚨 𑚠𑚴𑚥𑚯).","Kinnauri, Pahari",Indo-European
1,Pahari culture - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pahari_culture,"January 1, 2026 - The Pahari-speaking communities reside across various ecosystems such as the lush green hills of Himachal Pradesh and Uttarakhand to the rugged terrains of Jammu and Kashmir and northern Pakistan. All these territories and regions, including cross border regions are originally classified as the Indo-European ...","Kinnauri, Pahari",Indo-European
