4,Pahari Kinnauri language — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/pahari_kinnauri_language,"Pahari Kinnauri, also known as Kinnauri Pahari, is an Indo-Aryan language of the Western Pahari subgroup spoken primarily by Scheduled Caste communities in the Kinnaur district of Himachal Pradesh, India.","Kinnauri, Pahari",Indo-European
