7,Kinnauri Pop - Melodigging,https://www.melodigging.com/genre/kinnauri-pop,"It blends local Kinnauri (Kanauri) language melodies and festival dance rhythms with pan‑Indian pop production—acoustic guitars, synth pads, glossy drum programming, and catchy chorus hooks.","Kinnauri, Pahari",Indo-European
8,"Kinnauri-Pahari (version_0.1): parallel, monolingual dataset",https://www.ias.ac.in/article/fulltext/sadh/047/0123,"Kinnauri-Pahari is an Indo-Aryan language variation spo- ken mainly by the Scheduled Caste community in the · Kinnaur tehsils of Sangla, Moorang, Nichar, and Kalpa · villages of Kinnaur districts of Himachal Pradesh. It is · noted for its linguistic richness, with linguistic variations · from the Sino-Tibetan (Tibeto-Burman) and Indo-European ·","Kinnauri, Pahari",Indo-European
